+/// One continuous authorization attempt: which identity, which epoch, which
+/// relay.
+///
+/// All three matter. The identity alone cannot tell A → B → A apart from an
+/// ordinary A, and a relay switch leaves the identity untouched while making
+/// every in-flight answer — tokens included — belong to the wrong server.
